"""Registration counts and state silhouettes.

USCG_FLEET is lifted from the Coast Guard's own table, not estimated. The
figures that were on these pages before were wrong by 2-3x in most states
(New York was published at 1.3 million against an actual 428,445), which is
exactly the kind of number a reader or an answer engine can check in one
click. Primary source, cited on every page:

  US Coast Guard, Recreational Boating Statistics 2024 (COMDTPUB P16754.38),
  Table 38 - Recreational Vessel Registration Data by State.

OUTLINE holds a normalised SVG path per state in a 100x100 box, derived from
US Census TIGER boundaries (public domain), Douglas-Peucker simplified to a
few hundred bytes each so they inline without weighing the page down.
"""

